<main>
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__bg" src="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-240.webp"
       srcset="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-240.webp 1600w,
               ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-240-300w.webp 300w,
               ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-240-768w.webp 768w,
               ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-240-1280w.webp 1280w"
       sizes="100vw"
       width="1600" height="1111" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Camp 99 asia camp99asia">
  <div class="hero__content container">
    <h1>Camp 99</h1>
    <h2>Camp 99 is a day-use meeting, retreat, and recreation center for Christians.</h2>
    <a class="hero__cta" href="https://web.facebook.com/Camp99Camp99/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">we have facebook &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="about container">
  <span class="section-marker">/ 01</span>
  <h2>about</h2>
  <h3>Purpose of Camp 99</h3>
  <div class="about__grid">
    <div class="about__text">
      <p>Camp 99, named after our street address,<br>is serving the &#8217;99&#8217;, the Flock of the Lord!</p>
      <p>We envisage Camp 99 to be a place where Christian groups, both foreigner and Thai, can hold meetings, Bible studies, prayer and worship times, sports events, concerts, picnics and more.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about__images">
      <img src="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-212.webp"
           srcset="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-212.webp 1280w,
                   ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-212-300w.webp 300w,
                   ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-212-500w.webp 500w,
                   ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-212-1024w.webp 1024w,
                   ./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-facility-212-768w.webp 768w"
           sizes="(max-width: 600px) 456px, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px"
           width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" alt="Camp 99 asia camp99asia">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="services container">
  <span class="section-marker">/ 02</span>
  <h2>services</h2>
  <h3>Serving the 99</h3>
  <div class="services__grid">
    <article class="service-card">
      <img src="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-icon-events.png" width="65" height="65" alt="Events" loading="lazy">
      <h3>events</h3>
      <p>Indoor meeting room is available 7:30am until 10pm.  Outdoor recreation and game area is available 8am until 6pm. Soccer/footballs, volleyballs, badminton equipment and ping-pong items are provided. We even have pullover practice jerseys for football! Outdoor concerts are possible if you provide extra lighting and sound equipment. There&#8217;s a campfire pit near the pond that&#8217;s got a nice feel, even if it is a touch warm out!</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <img src="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-icon-entertainment.png" width="65" height="65" alt="Entertainment" loading="lazy">
      <h3>Meetings/Worship/Prayer/Small Groups</h3>
      <p>The inside meeting room 50sq.m. with two sofas, two long tables, and 20 chairs. Has 55&#8243; smart TV with fiber optic internet, DVD player, and powerful, clear speakers. Acoustic-electric guitar (but no amp yet) and drum box are available for you to use. Water cooler and cups are in this room.</p>
      <p>Our beautiful pond has a sala/cabana for up to 8-12 people. We also have a 3mx3m tent/awning if needed. Full kitchen is available to use, however we are unable to provide meals at this time.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <img src="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-icon-fishing.png" width="65" height="65" alt="Fishing" loading="lazy">
      <h3>fishing</h3>
      <p>There are indeed Talapia fish in the pond which we stock every couple of months. We have three spinning rods and seven bamboo poles. Some supplies are provided in our tackle box.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <img src="./images/camp99asia-camp99-asia-icon-relax.png" width="65" height="65" alt="Sports" loading="lazy">
      <h3>Sports</h3>
      <p>Footsal field can handle 6v6 adults or 8v8 kids. It is 42&#215;22 meters. Sturdy volleyball net is on grass and is regulation height for women; lined with chalk.  Regulation Takraw court with durable net&#8230; can double as badminton since they&#8217;re the same exact dimensions.  Also have a fun badminton area, not lined yet. Covered ping-pong area is in the car-park. A second table is available if reserved in advance.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
